# 13. Risks and mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Workspace switch reloads extension host and loses chat context | Persist state before switching; resume notification opens chat with `/resume` |
| Codebase too large for LLM context | Repo map + keyword-scored file selection with token budget; planner can request more files via a `read_file` tool in a second pass |
| Implementer makes unbounded or unsafe edits | Iteration cap, path confinement, whitelisted commands, undoable `WorkspaceEdit`, diff review before push |
| Build never green | Bounded fix loop, then hand back to user with exact errors and redo option |
| Unknown test-runner UI | Selector profiles, codegen recorder, manual-fallback with browser kept open |
| Secrets leaking to chat history or logs | SecretStorage, secure input boxes, global redactor, secret wipe on close |
| Force-pull destroys local work | Dirty-tree policy defaults to abort; stash safety net; pre-op SHA logged |

